IEcommerceMallCustomerReview.description:
Full customer review entity representing a product rating and written feedback after delivery.

Contains the review ID, numeric rating (1-5 stars), optional text content, and all timestamps for creation, update, and soft deletion. Includes relationships to the customer who wrote the review, the product being reviewed, the order containing the purchased item, and the specific order item that was delivered.

Soft delete is supported through the deleted_at timestamp field — when null the review is active, when set the review is preserved for audit purposes but hidden from normal queries.

@see IEcommerceMallCustomerReview.ISummary for the compact list view
@see IEcommerceMallCustomerReview.ICreate for review creation
@see IEcommerceMallCustomerReview.IUpdate for review modification
